<title>SWITZERLAND: Credit Suisse offers funds in Russia.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse offers funds in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse Group said its investment fund unit is offering a Rouble money market fund, a hard currency money market fund and will soon offer a large capitalisation equity fund in Russia.</p>
<p>All three funds are registered with the Russian Federal Commission on Securities Markets and are targeted at Russian private and institutional investors, the company said.</p>
<p>The funds are being distributed through Credit Suisse First Boston (Moscow) Ltd. The placement period began on December 16, 1996. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
